---
// Final CTA: a sober, bytes-themed call to the spec.
---
<section class="section cta">
  <div class="container cta__inner">
    <h2 class="cta__title">Ready to ship bytes, not sentences?</h2>
    <p class="cta__lede">
      Codec is source-available under BSL 1.1, free for non-production use
      and for production use under US&nbsp;$5M annual revenue.
    </p>
    <div class="cta__buttons">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://github.com/wdunn001/Codec" rel="noopener">Read the spec</a>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:licensing@quasarke.com">Commercial licensing</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta { padding-bottom: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 7rem); }
  .cta__inner {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 0% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--data) 14%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(120% 140% at 100% 100%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--control) 10%, transparent), transparent 55%),
      var(--bg-elev);
  }
  .cta__title { max-width: 24ch; }
  .cta__lede { max-width: 60ch; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
  .cta__buttons { display: inline-flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.625rem; }
</style>
